      "title": "Produce genuine integrability and count-map transport",
      "formula": "\\int g\\,d\\lambda_N=\\int g(S_N)\\,d\\mu_N,\\qquad g\\in L^1(\\gamma)\\cap L^1(\\lambda_N),\\quad g\\circ S_N\\in L^1(\\mu_N)."
